    "template": "{#- DesCode2Tag: the tags of a problem from its statement, notes and solution. Approved before the first request and never edited after it (docs/adr/0003). It is the Code2Tag prompt with four problem lines after the opening sentence: deleting lines 2 to 5 of a rendered prompt gives the Code2Tag prompt, which verify_extra checks. A missing field prints None, so the block is always four labelled lines. Same style, constants and tag list as code2tag.j2. -#}\nPredict the tags of a programming problem given a program written in {{ lang_cluster }} language to solve it.\nDescription: {{ prob_desc_description }}\nInput Specification: {{ prob_desc_input_spec }}\nOutput Specification: {{ prob_desc_output_spec }}\nNotes: {{ prob_desc_notes }}\n\nHere is the code:\n\n{{ source_code }}\n\nChoose the tags from this list: {{ all_tags | join(\", \") }}\n\nProvide the tags of the problem, separated by commas, without any description or extra tokens.\n",
